s":"0x1dFd9c22B6C37AFa6332E784D860159876575877","description":"ERGER keeps one book per share. The same share trades as five to nine tokens from different issuers, each at its own price, and most of the raw gap between them is unit multipliers. The book reads each issuer's multiplier from that issuer's own source, divides it out, and measures every row in basis points from one reference price, Chainlink on Robinhood Chain where a feed exists, with its source and age beside it. A row the book cannot read says unread and shows no number. Stock Tokens on Robinhood Chain are the rows the desk can buy; xStocks, Ondo, Binance bStocks and Coinbase appear by issuer name for reference. The desk runs in your browser. It makes a one-time position account and keeps its key encrypted on your device, funds a basket from shielded ZEC through NEAR Intents, buys each leg through Uniswap with a simulation, a minimum out and a deadline, and exits through USDG to a fresh shielded address. No MERGER server holds a key or your funds. The wallet that paid stays unlinked from the position. The position account and every trade it makes are public on Robinhood Chain. The ZEC amount and time where you enter and leave the rail are public on Zcash, and anyone can read the exit payout's amount, receiving address and memo. The rail publishes its record of each leg to anyone who holds the deposit address. You post a receipt to X that shows the mix by percentage and the week. A size band, the exact day, a handle proven by a post and the position account are yours to add, and no receipt shows an address on Zcash, a transaction id, an exact amount or an exact time. $MERGER launched on Pons as a fair launch and carries no yield, no share of fees and no claim on the book or on any Stock Token. Stock Tokens are not offered to US persons and are restricted in Canada, the UK and Switzerland. That rule is yours to keep. MERGER is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected with Robinhood Markets, Inc., Electric Coin Co., the Zcash Foundation, ZODL, NEAR, or any token issuer shown in the book. Merge the market. Unlink the wallet. Post the receipt.","icon":"wIEC-hMpzd9JM5R0","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/0gIRu0mHVOkfXxbr?width=900&height=300&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/robinhood/0x1dfd9c22b6c37afa6332e784d860159876575877?timestamp=1790889000000","links":[{"url":"https://merger.click/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/mergerclick"}],"totalAmount":10,"amount":10},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/4k8v9yh6kkrls46btg68te1qhlkb7an8j5ycwq3ppump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"4K8V9yH6kKRLS46BTG68Te1QHLkb7an8J5YcWQ3ppump","description":"At the edge of certainty, a new force takes shape. Super Accelerationism turns uncertainty into momentum, carrying its signal through the Solana network.","icon":"UCVmP0O_NCNthz57","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/3dj80aB47o_NxNTu?width=900&height=300&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/4K8V9yH6kKRLS46BTG68Te1QHLkb7an8J5YcWQ3ppump?timestamp=1790889000000","links":[{"url":"https://superacceleration.world"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/SolSuperAcc"}],"totalAmount":100,"amount":100},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/7kepapdbbmbyrmqihz3bht2umhfqcatjfsfqckq66kh3","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"7KEPApdbBMByrmqihz3bht2uMhFQcatjfSFQCKq66kH3","description":"privacy swaps powered by near intents with solana orgins","icon":"uuqslzhMnHe8ByIq","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/PDJ36JjWaB_98W_n?width=900&height=300&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/7KEPApdbBMByrmqihz3bht2uMhFQcatjfSFQCKq66kH3?timestamp=1790889000000","links":[{"url":"https://darkswap.app"},{"url":"https://darkswap.app/docs"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/darkswapapp"}],"totalAmount":10,"amount":10},{"u